## Animation Timing

| Interaction | Duration |
|------------|----------|
| Direct toggle (expand/collapse) | 100–200ms |
| Route transition (slide) | 150–250ms |
| Suspense reveal (skeleton → content) | 200–400ms |
| Shared element morph | 300–500ms |

